6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'll look into supervised mornings on the next lane and the visit to the station block's bin house.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm on it! I'll check the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
