25,2,1,talk,May,,"It's clear one house has suffered most. Also, some of our frontages are far too narrow for a bin bay.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The next lane's supervision takes nearly an hour, and the station block's bin house actually smells worse in summer.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"We're spending thousands on nets and deodorants already, and a new shelter is quite expensive even with a subsidy.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Midori,,"People are reluctant to police their neighbors, and the station block ended up fighting over maintenance costs.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The truck arrives very early, and the paperwork for a permanent build or site changes is quite tedious.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, if it's expensive, we need a fair way to split it. @Mizuki, is the smell really that bad?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Yes, the enclosed one traps the scent. @Servas, how early is the truck exactly?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Kenji,,The ledger shows we're bleeding money on small fixes. We need a real solution.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, I agree we need fairness, but we must avoid creating new reasons to argue.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Servas,,It arrives between 7:40 and 8:15. That is quite early for some of us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,May,,"@Midori, fairness is the only way to keep the peace. @Servas, the filing sounds like a nightmare.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If the truck is that early, a strict window for putting out trash might be impossible.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, if we build something, can we ensure the cost doesn't burden anyone too much?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, that's the worry. The station block's minutes show that maintenance causes the most friction.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Servas,,Indeed. A permanent structure requires a site plan and four months of waiting.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
