50,3,1,talk,May,,"The options are Rotating Location, Managed Collection Hours, or an Enclosed Structure. I dislike the structure's cost and the hours' rigidity.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Rotating seems most flexible, though the narrow frontages May mentioned might be a problem for some.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"An Enclosed Structure is too pricey. Managed Hours sounds easy, but the truck arrives too early.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I fear Managed Hours will lead to arguments about who is ""late."" Rotating seems more balanced.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Rotating requires a new notice for every change. However, the Enclosed Structure is a bureaucratic burden.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,May,,"@Mizuki, if we rotate, we must account for the narrow spots. But it's fairer than one person suffering.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, I agree. Managed Hours would just mean we're all awake at 7 AM policing each other.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, is the notice for rotating really that bad? It's better than paying for a shed.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, I think Rotating is the best for our relationships. No one is the permanent ""victim.""","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a bit of paperwork, but it avoids the long-term maintenance disputes Midori mentioned.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,May,,I vote for Rotating Location. It's the only one that addresses the gate issue.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll vote for Rotating Location too. It avoids the smell of a bin house.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm with you. Rotating Location it is.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Midori,,I agree. Rotating Location keeps the peace.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Servas,,I shall also vote for Rotating Location. It is the most sustainable path.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
